/-- **Every system of `ν Antiprism.HendecagonalAntiprism.polyhedron` has its one root at `ν Antiprism.HendecagonalAntiprism.polyhedron`**: each of the systems of `prismHendecagonalAntiprism_nu_roots_list` has exactly one root, and its scale is the Nieuwland number. -/
theorem prismHendecagonalAntiprism_nu_shared_list :
