/-- **The representatives of `ν Antiprism.HendecagonalAntiprism.polyhedron`**: the same system, each with exactly one root, at the scale `ν Antiprism.HendecagonalAntiprism.polyhedron`. -/
theorem prismHendecagonalAntiprism_nu_reps_list :
